@startuml
' Figure 21.3  Compaction at threshold
' Reading order: top to bottom in time. The assembler finds the next
' step would pass 33,600 tokens, 70% of the budget (run-0016, step 19,
' in the lab). Old tool results are cleared first; the compactor then
' re-derives a structured summary from the trail with pinned facts kept
' verbatim, and the verifier checks every identifier and amount before
' the summary replaces the old steps. A failed check keeps the history.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Assembler" as S <<ops>>
participant "Compactor" as C <<model>>
participant "Verifier" as V <<verified>>
database "Trail" as T <<evidence>>
S -> S : 36,364 > 33,600
S -> S : clear tool results
S -> C : older steps
C -> T : read
C --> S : summary, pins
S -> V : check
V -> T : IDs, amounts
V -[$VERIFIED]-> S : pass
S -> T : compacted
S -> S : 14,690
V -[$FAIL]-> S : fail: keep
@enduml
